plus, links to all of the sources
we cite for each of these topics.

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:46.160
My last two books were
“How to Survive a Pandemic”

00:13:46.160 --> 00:13:48.960
and my “How Not to Diet Cookbook”.

00:13:48.960 --> 00:13:52.040
Get ready this year for the
launch of “How Not to Age”.

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:54.040
And, of course, all the proceeds
I receive from the sales

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:57.000
of all my books goes
directly to charity.

00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:00.240
NutritionFacts.org is a nonprofit,
science-based public service,

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:01.840
where you can sign up
for free daily updates

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:06.080
on the latest in nutrition research
with bite-sized videos and articles

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:08.840
uploaded nearly every day.

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:10.520
Everything on the
website is free.

00:14:10.520 --> 00:14:12.760
There’s no ads, no
corporate sponsorships,

00:14:12.760 --> 00:14:13.440
no kickbacks.

00:14:13.440 --> 00:14:16.320
It’s strictly non-commercial.
I’m not selling anything.

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:19.400
I just put it up as a public service,
as a labor of love,

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:21.720
as a tribute to
my grandmother,

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:28.680
whose own life was saved
with evidence-based nutrition.

